        "created_at": "2012-11-22T23:27:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Tempest has one arm? How have I totally failed to notice that in about a zillion plays? Though I seem to recall he's clutching one of his arms (which is bleeding) on his Incapacitated side…Anyway, yeah, Chrono Ranger looks cool! Looking forward to seeing all the new decks when the expansion finally comes out :D.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Freedom Six Tempest straight up lost it.&nbsp; But don't worry.&nbsp; He replaced it WITH A LIGHTNING BOLT!!!</p>",
