        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lcinn/{size}/2659_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-23T15:12:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have often wondered how a time-travelling ranger would end up being the nemesis of plaguerat (how come we've known about chrono ranger's name such a long time? Did they spoil it?). I love the answer, it's a really cool hero-villain relation, different from the usual.</p>",
