        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-23T15:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>LCinn it's been supposition but the name Chorno-Ranger appeared in Plague Rat's deck as a quote source (\"Infection\"), and a picture also appeared on one of his cards (\"Shadowy Ambush\") and people looked at the sheriff's star nemesis symbol and the visuals and went, \"Yup, those fit together. Chrono-Ranger is probably Plague Rat's nemesis\" and we gradually lost the \"probably\".</p>",
